The `{{ namespace }}.{{ collection_name }}` Ansible collection manages the configuration of an existing {{ product | mandatory('Missing required variable: product') }} installation through its REST API. Each module brings one kind of record into the state you declare and reports what it found or changed.
{% endfilter %}{{ '' }}

The collection does not install or bootstrap the product and does not create
API credentials.
{# end skeleton-variant #}

